async function importEnvironment(file){try{toast('Leyendo el entorno 3D…');const src=await readFile(file),options={units:+$('siteUnits').value,axis:$('siteAxis').value};const root=await parseModel(src,{...options,normalize:false});const id=crypto.randomUUID();sourceLibrary.set(id,src);root.userData.sourceId=id;root.userData.options=options;if(importedSite)importedSite.parent?.remove(importedSite);importedSite=root;scene.add(root);setSiteVisibility();$('clearSite').hidden=false;scheduleAutosave();toast('Entorno importado. Su origen debe coincidir con la base de la Virgen. Unidades: '+options.units+' m por unidad.');}catch(e){toast(e.message);}}
function refreshBenchEditor(){const g=benchObjects[+$('benchSelect').value];if(!g)return;$('benchEast').value=g.position.x.toFixed(2);$('benchNorth').value=(-g.position.z).toFixed(2);$('benchHeading').value=(90-g.rotation.y/d2r).toFixed(1);}
